 grids. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, November to December finished at 38% of normal on the middle of the grids, while April to May hit 174%. All 5 grids had their driest year in 2007, with grid 16979 at 54%.</p>"}
